Music-Data-Vizualization/
├── index.html        Home (the story)
├── explore.html      Explore (the data explained)
├── compare.html      Compare (genre duet + rank mismatch)
├── css/style.css     one stylesheet for all three pages
├── assets/staff.svg  the musical background tile
├── data/music.csv    the single dataset
└── js/
    ├── data.js       shared store: loads the CSV once, holds shared state
    ├── ui.js         tooltip, genre chips, error banner, nav playhead
    ├── main.js       Home orchestrator (draws the four charts, Scrollama)
    ├── bars.js, bubbles.js, heatmap.js, barsRecolored.js   the four Home charts
    ├── explore.js    Explore page logic
    └── compare.js    Compare page logic